    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you\u2019ve unraveled '<i>Return of the Obra Dinn</i>' and '<i>The Case of the Golden Idol</i>' to the end...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This time, become an investigator who writes the death certificate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/88c510241a396b55aff11339fcdf3b7c.poster.avif?t=1755593921\" width=544 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/88c510241a396b55aff11339fcdf3b7c.webm?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/88c510241a396b55aff11339fcdf3b7c.mp4?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1959, a foggy countryside mansion near London.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A string of mysterious deaths unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must examine perplexing crime scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>and personally write death certificates and emergency reports.</i></strong><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/b176f161e2f57e76b6fee1e4c2998677.poster.avif?t=1755593921\" width=544 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/b176f161e2f57e76b6fee1e4c2998677.webm?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/b176f161e2f57e76b6fee1e4c2998677.mp4?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Who was the victim?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Was it suicide\u2026 or murder?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If murder\u2014who did it?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>'Death at Fleming Manor'</i></strong> is not just a detective game. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It\u2019s a forensic mystery adventure where you write the truth.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Examine the body.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate the suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then document your findings in official reports\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >because your words shape the final narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/3855844aeb7fd1147b126df812d6f518.poster.avif?t=1755593921\" width=544 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/3855844aeb7fd1147b126df812d6f518.webm?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/3855844aeb7fd1147b126df812d6f518.mp4?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Art \u00d7 Sharp Deduction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals inspired by 1960s European comic books</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and classic presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven gameplay experience that feels like living through a vintage mystery novel</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/0ae3761c697dd11bcbc02daa39e9e3bc.poster.avif?t=1755593921\" width=544 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/0ae3761c697dd11bcbc02daa39e9e3bc.webm?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/0ae3761c697dd11bcbc02daa39e9e3bc.mp4?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended for players who:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love the vibe of classic mysteries by Agatha Christie or Arthur Conan Doyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crave detailed investigations, forensic documentation, and logical deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer deep, story-centric mystery games over fast-paced action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Your pen will uncover</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>the dark secrets of the manor.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It\u2019s time to record the case.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Realistic forensic document-writing gameplay</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A mystery set in a lavish 1950s British manor</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stylized visuals inspired by 1960s vintage detective comics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Examine crime scenes and piece together the truth from scattered clues.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Perfect for fans of Agatha Christie, Arthur Conan Doyle, and vintage whodunits</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you\u2019ve unraveled '<i>Return of the Obra Dinn</i>' and '<i>The Case of the Golden Idol</i>' to the end...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This time, become an investigator who writes the death certificate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/88c510241a396b55aff11339fcdf3b7c.poster.avif?t=1755593921\" width=544 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/88c510241a396b55aff11339fcdf3b7c.webm?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/88c510241a396b55aff11339fcdf3b7c.mp4?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1959, a foggy countryside mansion near London.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A string of mysterious deaths unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must examine perplexing crime scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>and personally write death certificates and emergency reports.</i></strong><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/b176f161e2f57e76b6fee1e4c2998677.poster.avif?t=1755593921\" width=544 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/b176f161e2f57e76b6fee1e4c2998677.webm?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/b176f161e2f57e76b6fee1e4c2998677.mp4?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Who was the victim?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Was it suicide\u2026 or murder?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If murder\u2014who did it?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>'Death at Fleming Manor'</i></strong> is not just a detective game. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It\u2019s a forensic mystery adventure where you write the truth.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Examine the body.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate the suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then document your findings in official reports\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >because your words shape the final narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/3855844aeb7fd1147b126df812d6f518.poster.avif?t=1755593921\" width=544 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/3855844aeb7fd1147b126df812d6f518.webm?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/3855844aeb7fd1147b126df812d6f518.mp4?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Art \u00d7 Sharp Deduction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals inspired by 1960s European comic books</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and classic presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven gameplay experience that feels like living through a vintage mystery novel</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/0ae3761c697dd11bcbc02daa39e9e3bc.poster.avif?t=1755593921\" width=544 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/0ae3761c697dd11bcbc02daa39e9e3bc.webm?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/0ae3761c697dd11bcbc02daa39e9e3bc.mp4?t=1755593921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended for players who:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love the vibe of classic mysteries by Agatha Christie or Arthur Conan Doyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crave detailed investigations, forensic documentation, and logical deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer deep, story-centric mystery games over fast-paced action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Your pen will uncover</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>the dark secrets of the manor.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It\u2019s time to record the case.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Realistic forensic document-writing gameplay</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A mystery set in a lavish 1950s British manor</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stylized visuals inspired by 1960s vintage detective comics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Examine crime scenes and piece together the truth from scattered clues.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Perfect for fans of Agatha Christie, Arthur Conan Doyle, and vintage whodunits</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
